## Slide 13 — Scan discipline (process)
- Layout: Default Slide, Title only. Title: "How we made the scans complete".
- Body: BlockProcess, 4 steps:
  1. One scan at a time per destination
  2. Single-keyword over AND-query (timeout-safe)
  3. Independent markers — don't rely on naming
  4. Sanity scan beyond credential literals
- Below: short caption block — "All seven scans returned without truncation."

